===Player-owned house teleports=== 

Besides the [[portal nexus]] and [[portal chamber]]s, which are covered elsewhere, other teleports can also be built in player-owned houses. With 47 [[Construction]], [[amulet of glory (mounted)|mounted amulets of glory]] can be built in the [[guild trophy space]] of the [[quest hall]]. At 72 Construction, a [[mounted xeric's talisman]] can be built in the [[amulet space]] of the [[portal nexus]] room. At 47 construction, both the [[Mythical cape (mounted)|mythical cape]] and the [[Cape of legends (mounted)|cape of legends]], each retaining its teleportation functions, can be built in the guild trophy space of the quest hall in a player-owned house. At 82 [[Construction]], a [[curator's medallion]] can be mounted in a [[player-owned house]] [[portal nexus]] room, creating a [[mounted digsite pendant]]. At 80 Construction, players can build a [[cape hanger]] in the [[display space]] of the [[achievement gallery]] in a player-owned house; [[mythical cape]]s and [[capes of accomplishment]], including max variants, can have their teleportation functions used by the owner of the house but not by visitors. 

[[Teleport trap]]s can be built in the [[Dungeon (Construction)|dungeon]] of a player-owned house with 88 Construction. Players who fail to dodge the teleport trap will be teleported to the [[oubliette]]; if the dungeon does not contain an oubliette, players will be teleported to a random tile within the dungeon. If the dungeon contains multiple oubliettes, then players who fail to dodge the trap will be sent to the most expensive oubliette in the dungeon (or the one which was built last if multiple oubliettes are of equal value). Players who succeed in dodging the teleport trap will gain 20 [[Agility]] experience points, and jump to either side of the trap.

Three different levels of [[Achievement_gallery#Jewellery_box|jewellery boxes]] can be built in the jewellery box space of the achievement gallery. The jewellery box can store various teleportation [[jewellery]]. Each box will provide unlimited teleports to locations provided by the enchanted jewellery. Jewellery boxes are constructed in upgrades: before a higher level box can be built, the player must first build the one before it. Bank notes are NOT accepted, each item must be brought. 

